<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87900" body-key="">
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προκώνια</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλφιτα, τά,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>groats of fresh</i> or
				<i>unroasted barley,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.110
			</span></i>: without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλφιτα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1672.280
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				83
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.Byz.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>, etc.; but expld. as <i>groats of wheat and barley,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anticl.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροὶ μέλιτι κεχρισμένοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Did.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>, as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάχρυς κατηριγμέναι μετ᾽
				ἀρωμάτων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Demon
				22
			</span></i>: written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόκωνα</span></b> ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.77
			</span></i>:—also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυροὶ</span></div>
	</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
